  <sect2 role="package">
    <title>Introduksjon til websocketpp</title>

    <para>
      websocketpp pakken tilbyr et websocket klient/server bibliotek.
    </para>

    <itemizedlist spacing="compact">
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Nedlasting (HTTP): <ulink url="&websocketpp-download-http;"/>
        </para>
      </listitem>
    </itemizedlist>

    <bridgehead renderas="sect3">Ytterligere Nedlastinger</bridgehead>
    <itemizedlist spacing="compact">
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Påkrevd oppdatering:
          <ulink url="&websocket-patch-root;/websocketpp-&websocketpp-version;-boost-1.87-compat.patch"/>
        </para>
      </listitem>
    </itemizedlist>

    <bridgehead renderas="sect3">websocketpp Avhengigheter</bridgehead>

    <bridgehead renderas="sect4">Påkrevd</bridgehead>
    <para role="required">
      <ulink url="&blfs-svn;/general/cmake.html">CMake</ulink>
    </para>

    <bridgehead renderas="sect4">Anbefalt</bridgehead>
    <para role="recommended">
      <xref linkend="asio"/> og
      <ulink url="&blfs-svn;/general/boost.html">boost</ulink>
    </para>

  </sect2>

  <sect2 role="installation">
    <title>Installasjon av websocketpp</title>

<!-- Note that the word 'system' only shows up for Boost's system library in
     CMakeLists.txt, which was removed a while ago and breaks detection. -->

    <para>
      Først, bruk flere rettelser for å tillate bygging med boost-1.87 og nyere:
    </para>

<screen><userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../websocketpp-&websocketpp-version;-boost-1.87-compat.patch                       &amp;&amp;
sed 's|"${WEBSOCKETPP_BOOST_LIBS}"|${WEBSOCKETPP_BOOST_LIBS}|' -i CMakeLists.txt &amp;&amp;
sed 's/system//' -i CMakeLists.txt</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Installer websocketpp ved å kjøre følgende 
      kommandoer:
    </para>

<screen><userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;
cd    build &amp;&amp;

cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr        \
      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release         \
      -D CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH=ON      \
      -D CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5 \
      -D ENABLE_CPP11=ON                  \
      -D BUILD_TESTS=OFF                  \
      -G Ninja ..</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Nå, som &root; bruker:
    </para>

<screen role="root"><userinput>ninja install</userinput></screen>

  </sect2>

  <sect2 role="commands">
    <title>Parameterforklaringer</title>

    &cmake-skip-install-rpath;

    <para>
      <parameter>-D CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5</parameter>: Dette 
      tillater bygging med nyere CMake versjoner.
    </para>

    <para>
      <parameter>-D ENABLE_CPP11=ON</parameter>: Dette bygger støtte for 
      ISO C++11 standarden.
    </para>

    <para>
      <parameter>-D BUILD_TESTS=OFF</parameter>: Dette deaktiverer bygging av tester.
    </para>

  </sect2>

